WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:01.750
We are four best friends.

00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:04.833
The first rule we made
while entering this business was…

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:09.750
All four in or all out!

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:12.458
So how did four innocent,
middle-class boys,

00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:15.583
ended up Mumbai’s
top-class car thieves?

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:16.833
Wanna know?

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:22.375
Do you even have a plan?

00:00:23.041 --> 00:00:24.583
Chopra's Corteva 1984.

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:25.583
Let's steal it.

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:27.833
So… we'll steal
like professionals now?

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:34.000
Who is this guy?

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.166
A new car theft gang,

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.416
and I believe, this boy
might be running it.

00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:39.166
Impressive.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.875
You guys have become
celebrities overnight.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.250
You know Chopra's Corteva,

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:46.833
is like the Kohinoor of
imported cars in Mumbai.

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:49.125
Will you work with me?

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:49.875
What work?

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.875
Stealing cars for me, genius.

00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:56.041
Those who chase thrills
live longer.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.291
Hundred grand a car,
so ours will be…

00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:01.708
Twenty grand a ride.

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:03.791
I ain't asking. I'm telling.

00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:08.541
It will stay this way,
as long as we're running with Imtiyaz.

00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:09.291
So what's your play?

00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:10.416
Let’s start our own hustle.

00:01:11.625 --> 00:01:12.916
Did you boys
picked a fight with Imtiyaz.

00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:20.791
These guys are gangsters.

00:01:20.833 --> 00:01:22.875
They don't compete.
They erase the competition.

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:28.833
You boys are not mixed up
in some gang, right?

00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:29.666
Have you lost it?

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:31.583
Where are the boys?

00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:34.333
I am quitting this business.

00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:36.083
You dragged me into this
mess, and now you want out!

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:38.333
This is not the  time to
fight among ourselves.

00:01:40.291 --> 00:01:41.375
You have got the correct angle.

00:01:50.958 --> 00:01:52.208
We’re lucky...

00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:53.125
only when were together.

00:01:53.583 --> 00:01:54.083
Apart…

00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:55.125
we're done.

